# MT759 used by a virtual bank to reject a message at BUSINESS level (simulator convention).
# TODO verify against SWIFT UHB SR2021+ how a bank should reject a guarantee message (23H code / MT type); OTHERFNC is a placeholder.
# ${rejectReasons} = BIZ-xxx reasons wrapped to 65 z-characters per line
:27:1/1
:20:${newRef}
:21:${f20|ref|'NONREF'}
:22D:${ldg_form|f22D|formOfUndertaking|'UNDK'}
:23:${ref|'NONREF'}
:23H:OTHERFNC
:45D:BUSINESS REJECTION OF YOUR ${inboundType|'MESSAGE'}
REFERENCE ${f20|ref|'NONREF'} - NOT PROCESSED
${!rejectReasons}
